ing the 62-test owning library and management/runtime/both journals. Native authorization/cancellation/current policy/receipt metadata gates have no unresolved failures. No source worker/import scheduling or body ingestion is implemented by this capability. Server/CLI all-target check and strict lint pass. All 315 prior parsed evidence entries remain unchanged, total 316; parent raw JSON bytes retained before formatting. Owned settlement primitive complete; next is actual staged native source enrollment with renewed accepted-prefix checks, common reader/spool progress, bounded worker/frame/storage ownership and executable import scheduling. Public API/CLI/browser import, remaining readers/enabled startup and M17.3-M17.7 remain pending; full goal active."
