    "scope": "Existing retained source workers own preparation, guarded ingress/publication, reader/raw-frame budgets and already-bound storage. Body-free current target dispatch releases policy gates while queued. Native prefix preparation starts only with a reserved frame; current gates renew each step. Exact retry cannot replace a source command; other requests refuse without source reset. Incomplete/ready prefix state survives parking. Actual owned-state compaction, rather than stale cached observations, protects raw channels at handoff. Imported delivery remains on its guarded source owner; shared atomic transfer revokes stale generic delivery candidates and publisher awaits. Step settlement releases policy only after the future ends and retains original state/storage on pause, cancellation and deadlines. Original selector replay after a new runtime preserves selected boundary and existing session/cursor. Concrete escalation before wider runs: retained executor settlement, source handoff, shared delivery gating and runtime mailbox affect direct pipeline/worker/supervisor/lifecycle/storage/management consumers. Run owning library and direct admission/authority/source/resume/parking/reanchor/recovery/pipeline/pipeline-worker/supervisor/runtime/management/activation/both-journal suites serially, including existing cold storage ownership fixtures, plus server/direct CLI all-target checks and strict lint. No public wire/schema/CLI contract or UI change, so contract generation, UI/root aggregates, unrelated Rust workspace and real harness/storage/model qualification are out of scope. Public durable progress/API/CLI/browser, automatic restart dispatch, remaining harness readers/enabled startup, conversations/replay/checkpoints/search/reviews/portability and M17.3-M17.7 remain pending. M17.2 stays In progress and full goal active. Preserve all 317 prior evidence entries and their raw parent JSON prefix. No installation/publication/migration/restarts/subagents. Two mixed patches with duplicate path operations and one unmatched document hunk were rejected without mutations; reapplied with exact paths/text. Exact fixture failures were resolved by honoring settled runtime observation and using genuine retained raw-capacity input, without widening deadlines or weakening assertions. Final source/worker acceptance complete: nine scheduling regressions and two actual state/settlement regressions pass; required direct suites pass 189 top-level tests across 16 binaries, with ten prior native import tests and existing cold storage/lifecycle ownership evidence. Server/direct CLI all-target check and strict lint pass. Cached completed-prefix invalidation restores original exact rejection semantics while retaining incomplete scans across parking. Native MemoryStore/synthetic Codex evidence does not qualify real harness/RustFS release or enabled startup. All seven canonical/spec-first/boundary/architecture/progress/Rust/document format consumers pass. No unresolved functional failures. Existing macOS unwind-table linker warning remains unsuppressed. Retained library scheduling slice complete; M17.2 remains In progress. All 317 prior evidence entries and raw JSON prefix remain unchanged. Public progress/API/CLI/browser, automatic accepted-request restart dispatch, remaining readers/enabled startup and the full M17.3-M17.7 roadmap remain pending; full goal active."
