    "versions": "Rust 1.98.1; JJ 0.45.1; macOS ARM64. Synthetic qualified Codex/native MemoryStore and synthetic committed-receipt process-exit fixtures. No real harness/RustFS release qualification.",
    "formats": "Additive private reader-publication/catalog.json version 1, at most 4096 channels plus 4096 outstanding ranges within 2 MiB. No existing cursor/spool/source/control/import/native/HTTP/CLI schema changes. Domain-separated receipt and folded chain digests; current AgentStore only.",
    "revision": "enclosing Jujutsu change uqxsnnxq",
    "result": "pass",
    "remaining": [],
    "scope": "Reader ACKs are capture progress, not native publication. Automatic JSONL ingress preflights unchanged body preparation capacity, then selects body-free requirements under the existing mutation lock before acknowledgement. Exact validated receipts are synchronized before body removal. Contiguous source order crosses repository partitions; a later B receipt cannot cover an earlier A hole. Confirmed ranges fold into a durable digest chain and last receipt identity; pending unknown or identity-only removals remain holes. Restart and separate process exit retain coverage without duplicate receipt counts. Missing prior coverage never promotes acknowledged history. Corrupt/missing selected/private/foreign/oversized/symlinked state withholds; no paths, bodies or native keys are journal data. Concrete escalation: shared automatic enqueue, spool open/recovery and native drain affect the owning capture library/tests, server source/resume/parking/reanchor/recovery/pipeline/pipeline-worker/supervisor/runtime/activation plus native/scheduled import composition, and CLI shared spool/publication/local recovery consumers. Final suites run serially with original deadlines and within-scenario concurrency; server/CLI/capture all-target compilation and strict lint are direct compile consumers. No public wire, response runner or UI changed, so generated contracts, web/catalog/Storybook/root aggregate/full Rust workspace/unrelated RustFS/live harness lanes are out of scope. Exact accepted-import/channel association and bounded phase projection, HTTP/CLI/browser, automatic accepted-request restart dispatch, remaining readers/enabled startup and M17.3-M17.7 remain pending; full goal active, M17.2 In progress. Early owner-suite invocation began before quota repair and overlapped later narrow regressions; final required acceptance runs serially after final sources. A complete direct server run exposed one mixed-reader recovery regression. Shared reader enqueue now adds requirements only to existing automatic channels before cursor acknowledgement; no new channel or receipt authority is granted. Original exact native recovery failure goes one to zero, and all required direct lanes rerun on final sources. Patch contexts missed formatter-wrapped lines twice and applied no files; repaired against current text. Preserve all 318 prior evidence entries and their raw JSON prefix. No installation/publication/migration/daemon restart/subagents. Final serial acceptance passes 260 top-level entries: capture-final 136, native-import 10, scheduled-import 9, server-direct 74, cli-direct 31. Includes 14 new regressions (12 integration plus two catalog), separate process exit and existing cold/lifecycle/storage ownership fixtures. Original exact quota and mixed native recovery regressions each fail one to zero; no deadline/assertion weakened. Capture/server/direct CLI all-target compilation and strict lint pass; seven canonical/spec-first/boundary/architecture/progress/Rust/document consumers pass. No unresolved functional failures. This is synthetic native MemoryStore/receipt/device evidence, not real harness/RustFS release qualification. Current source publication coverage foundation is complete; per-request completion and public surfaces remain pending. Full goal stays active; M17.2 In progress. All 318 prior evidence entries and raw JSON prefix are unchanged. Wider pending roadmap: Exact accepted-import/channel association and bounded selected/pending/running/withheld/completed/unavailable projection. Typed local HTTP/CLI import and inspection with actual captured-response qualification; browser management. Automatic accepted-request restart dispatch, remaining harness readers and guarded enabled startup. Real harness/JJ/RustFS/UI/cold full-flow qualification; M17.3-M17.7 conversations/replay, checkpoints, search/reviews and archives/portability. One metadata checker failure came from putting wider roadmap gates in this completed evidence slice remaining field; moved them into scope/status/next action without changing milestone or goal completion."
  },
