    "formats": "Additive actor-free public version-1 import command, acceptance/progress/status DTOs and HTTP/OpenAPI/generated TypeScript. Private version-1 reader association adds prefix_verified, default false for older catalogs; verified upgrades preserve original generation and immutable receipt. Control/source/reader/publication/AgentStore persistence formats unchanged. Public receipts expose command, ordinal, profile/version, complete byte/record boundary; private digests/principals remain private. Body-free exact request observations remain runtime-private.",
